WEBVTT

00:05:26.491 --> 00:05:30.141
and those information
are afforded a weighted score.

00:05:31.055 --> 00:05:34.999
And our minds do not add
those pieces of information,

00:05:35.023 --> 00:05:38.622
but rather average
those pieces of information.

00:05:39.205 --> 00:05:44.668
So when you introduce irrelevant
or even weak arguments,

00:05:44.692 --> 00:05:47.072
those weak arguments, if you will,

00:05:47.096 --> 00:05:50.365
reduce the weight
of your overall argument.

00:05:52.064 --> 00:05:53.441
A few years ago,

00:05:53.465 --> 00:05:56.324
I landed in Philadelphia
one August evening

00:05:56.348 --> 00:05:57.738
for a conference.

00:05:58.326 --> 00:06:00.821
Having just gotten off
a transatlantic flight,